            "day_1_activity_2",
            "day_1_activity_3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_activity_1",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "• **Morning/Afternoon:** Arrive at Narita (NRT) or Haneda (HND) Airport, transfer to your hotel, check-in, and settle."
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_activity_2",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "• **Afternoon:** Visit Shinjuku Gyoen National Garden. A beautiful oasis perfect for unwinding after travel."
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_activity_3",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "• **Evening:** Ascend to the Tokyo Metropolitan Government Building Observation Decks for free panoramic city views. Explore Shinjuku's bustling streets and enjoy dinner."
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_attractions_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "variant": "h5",
          "text": "Key Attractions"
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_attractions_list",
          "component": "List",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "children": [
            "day_1_attraction_1",
            "day_1_attraction_2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_attraction_1",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "• **Shinjuku Gyoen National Garden:** A large park with traditional Japanese, French, and English landscape gardens."
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_attraction_2",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "• **Tokyo Metropolitan Government Building:** Free observation decks offering stunning views of Tokyo, including Mount Fuji on clear days."
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_cost_title",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "**Estimated Daily Cost (Family of 4):** USD 320"
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_cost_list",
          "component": "List",
          "direction": "vertical",
          "children": [
            "day_1_cost_1",
            "day_1_cost_2",
            "day_1_cost_3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_cost_1",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "• Transportation (trains/subway): USD 50"
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_cost_2",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "• Meals (lunch, dinner, snacks): USD 200"
        },
        {
          "id": "day_1_cost_3",
          "component": "Text",
          "text": "• Activities (garden entry, observation deck free): USD 70"
        },
